This artefact contains Clojure transcriptions of, and data derived from:

  tau2-bench (https://github.com/sierra-research/tau2-bench)
    Copyright (c) 2025 Sierra Research. MIT License.
    Transcribed: the tools, the episode protocol and the grading of the
    retail, banking, airline and telecom domains.
    resources/benchmarks/tau2/*.json are tool schemas emitted by upstream's
    code.

  Berkeley Function Calling Leaderboard, part of Gorilla
  (https://github.com/ShishirPatil/gorilla)
    Apache License 2.0.
    Transcribed: the AST checker and the tool compilation of the Python
    single-turn categories.

  resources/benchmarks/rss and resources/benchmarks/permutation are pinned
  snapshots of replikativ sources (dvergr-sandbox, spindel), Apache License
  2.0; each directory carries its LICENSE and a README with the exact commit.

tau2 and BFCL task data is not included: it is read from pinned upstream checkouts
(../tau2-bench, ../gorilla).
